  "description": {
    "text": "A preview Expansion Sheet of Pikachu, Mewtwo and Mew, sold at the 7th Next Generation World Hobby Fair, which opened at the Fukuoka Dome on 7 December 1997 and toured Japan until 15 February 1998, before the first vending machine series. Officially the cards are unnumbered promos, but collectors count the sheet with the Vending Series as its 'Series 00'.",
